<title>HONG KONG: Unit of South Korea's Kohap sets US$60 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Unit of South Korea's Kohap sets US$60 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger KDB Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  KOHAP GLOBAL INVESTMENT LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR KOHAP LTD &amp; KOHAP PETROCHEMCIAL</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$60 MLN   COUPON     6ML+80BP   MATURITY 5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH   25.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3	  CALLS	YR 3	 REPLIES  12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING   LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS   US$250K</p>
<p> RATING    --	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE  24.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES     THE BORROWER IS 20 PERCENT OWNED BY KOHAP INC, </p>
<p>		51 PERCENT BY KOHAP LTD AND 29</p>
<p>	     PERCENT BY KOHAP PETROCHEMICAL</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	ARRANGERS &amp; CO-LEADS  US$7MLN+   135 BP ALL-IN 125 BP</p>
<p>	CO-ARGRS &amp; CO-LEADS   US$4-6 MLN 123 BP ALL-IN 121 BP</p>
<p>	SENIOR MANAGERS	 US$2-3 MLN 114 BP ALL-IN 118 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS KDB ASIA AND HANIL BANK</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
